# The demo bundle is committed on purpose: it is what lets a deployment start
# with inspections to show without running OCR during its build.
#
# These negations must come last. gitignore resolves by last-match-wins, and
# the `*.db` rule above would otherwise re-exclude the database while leaving
# its evidence images tracked -- a bundle that restores 45 photographs and no
# records to attach them to.
!data/demo/
!data/demo/**
